<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="09">
<name>SRS Airbag &amp; Seat Belt</name>
<section id="1000Y_S0012" variety="S0012">
<name>SRS Airbag</name>
<ttl id="1000Y_S0012_745Q2_T00B8" variety="T00B8">
<name>SRS Airbag System</name>
<para id="RM000000ELD00KX" category="C" type-id="305D8" name-id="554GO-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B1615</dtccode>
<dtcname>Front airbag sensor LH malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000ELD00KX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000069700000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The front airbag sensor LH circuit consists of the airbag computer assembly and front airbag sensor LH. </ptxt>
<ptxt>The front airbag sensor LH detects impacts and sends signals to the airbag computer assembly to determine whether to deploy the airbags. </ptxt>
<ptxt>When a malfunction is detected in the front airbag sensor LH circuit, DTC B1615 is stored in the airbag computer assembly. </ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Trouble Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B1615</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Front airbag sensor LH malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Airbag Computer Assembly Malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Front Airbag Sensor LH</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Airbag Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000ELD00KX_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000069800000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C159565J02" width="7.106578999in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000ELD00KX_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000ELD00KX_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELD00KX_04_0019" proc-id="RM0550J___000069A00000">
<scantool type="2"/>
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the battery negative terminal and wait for 90 seconds.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Make sure the ignition switch is OFF before disconnecting the cable from the negative (-) battery terminal.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C161466J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Interchange the front airbag sensor LH with the front airbag sensor RH, connect the connectors and install them securely.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When installing, do not subject the front airbag sensor RH and front airbag sensor LH to strong impacts such as dropping them. </ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If a sensor has been subjected to a strong impact such as being dropped, replace it with a new one. </ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the battery negative terminal, turn IG ON and wait for 60 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000050J01GX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000ELD00KX_04_0005" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELD00KX_04_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___000069900000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Inspect Front Airbag Sensor LH</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000050J01GX"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Result:</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.88in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC B1610 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC B1615 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000ELD00KX_04_0006" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000000ELD00KX_04_0008" fin="true">B</right>
<right ref="RM000000ELD00KX_04_0009" fin="true">C</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELD00KX_04_0006">
<testtitle>Perform Simulation Method<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELD00KX_04_0008">
<testtitle>Replace Front Airbag Sensor LH<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000007U200RX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000ELD00KX_04_0009">
<testtitle>Replace Airbag Computer Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002RR0002X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
